{"ID":"20240206103118-cbevsht","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206103118-cbevsht","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206103118-cbevsht\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206103127-r2blfiu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206103121-ikxpyhn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206103127-r2blfiu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:117,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:117\u0026#125;","title":"丝瓜络","type":"doc","updated":"20240830103441"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206103127-r2blfiu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206103127-r2blfiu","updated":"20240206103132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t各地均产，浙江慈溪和江苏所产质量最佳。\n【性状】\t药材为丝状维管束交织而成，多呈长棱形或长圆筒形，略弯曲，长3070cm，直径710cm。表面淡黄白色。体轻，质韧，有弹性，不能折断。横切面可见子房3室，呈空洞状。气微，味淡。\n【性味】\t甘，平。\n【功效】\t通络，活血，祛风。用于痹痛拘挛、胸胁胀痛、乳汁不通。"}]},{"ID":"20240206103121-ikxpyhn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206103121-ikxpyhn","updated":"20240206103121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206103121-ot3sbnj.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709105405-09gy8pr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709105405-09gy8pr","updated":"20240709105502"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 304px;","style":"width: 294px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"丝瓜络"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/丝瓜络-20240709105405-zn4w6j2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: sty